      "writtenOn": "2022-06-10T19:43:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Many of these values don\u0027t feel like adjusting hardware Caps. For example, the user-defined ShaderErrorHandler isn\u0027t related to anything in hardware. Maybe store the struct in the Caps with an options() accessor?\n\nAnd I was planning on passing it down to the Recorder, but that still doesn\u0027t work accessing it to set up the ShaderErrorHandler. So I agree it needs to be someplace more accessible.",
